andidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A member of the idol group \"Seas May\", who secretly fights crime as the magical girl Strange Juice. Whenever she is flustered or alone, she ends up speaking in the Tsugaru dialect which she picked up in her early childhood. When the characters in her name are read differently, her name is a pun on the phrase \"ally of justice\" (正義の味方 seigi no mikata)."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c44350"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ac/acbff781034a2d68e44046bdcbb5d01f4f050f06b24770e014df1a7aafbe80df.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/05/05b7c368767ec55b75733f3c9776da0d09e1c7c9981aeeea20f165537c382099.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"雨宮 天","creatorId":"vndb:s7409","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s7409","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7409","name":"雨宮 天","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:68395","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c44351","characterName":"台初 明香","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c44351"},"originalCharacterName":"台初 明香","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A genius inventor who happens to be the landlady of the apartment all the characters are living in. Meika has unrivalled hacking skills, however she has very poor physical reflexes. Her name is a pun on the phrase \"great inventor\" (大発明家 Daihatsumei-ka)."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c44351"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/09/09345dd10a6e939bdae3118aa9a93313d8df1c47882cb276426845d35ea1c10e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e2/e2c00e437640093204c0b8383db568523d3b1e7e71971dca50c3a99b384fcc14.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"釘宮 理恵","creatorId":"vndb:s500","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s500","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s500","name":"釘宮理恵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:68391","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c44352","characterName":"曳尾谷 愛","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c44352"},"originalCharacterName":"曳尾谷 愛","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A NEET who spends most of her time playing online games and taking care of her pet Muhi, a bear cub. Her name is a pun on the term \"HikiOtaNEET\" (ヒキオタニート), a portmanteau of hikikomori, otaku, and NEET."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c44352"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/01/01b7a4038d6d12c0af8d37a8a5ed2b67049d312ee5e5bfde1fbf21e09e577933.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b7/b78e54c134709f4c830fb88ab58afa479a9d55f3faea841480a1ed4a03de316f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"寿 美菜子","creatorId":"vndb:s5749","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5749","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5749","name":"寿 美菜子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:68394","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c44353","characterName":"秩父 ラブラ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c44353"},"originalCharacterName":"秩父 ラブラ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A gyaru who works as an exorcist. Despite her profession, she does not believe in the existence of spirits. Her name is a pun on \"chichi burabura\" (乳ブラブラ, lit. \"breasts dangling\")."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c44353"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/16/16dfb38c6c6e55f4436bcec3fdc076c5d0172314c14ffb82f505a13d296eac8b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b9/b9d366df22368793a5ed30b8c800d141ac0559d0d85a99dc806ea274a79cec5f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"戸松 遥","creatorId":"vndb:s5478","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5478","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5478","name":"戸松 遥","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:68393","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c44354","characterName":"伊里達 遊太","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c44354"},"originalCharacterName":"伊里達 遊太","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist who gets superpowers from looking at panties. However, if he sees panties more than one time in a row, the world blows up from a meteor. Due to his soul being separated